From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kristof Imeri <kristof@lanth.me>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 07:12:19 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] compositor: give glass a Niko material

Niko glass follows Acrylic: it blurs what is behind it like Luca, twice
as wide, then takes the luminosity of the Niko tint as far as the shell
says, the hue and saturation of the tint as far as its alpha says, and a
faint speckle of noise. It blurs only the wallpaper whenever Luca does.
Apps hear it as its own material, draw no tint of their own over it and
can ask for it.

Upstream-Status: luft-only Kestrel's Niko material
